---
import opening from "../data/hero-media.json";
import deck from "../data/deck.json";
---

<section id="media-description" class="media-description" aria-labelledby="media-heading">
  <h2 id="media-heading">Video description & sources</h2>
  <section aria-labelledby="opening-description-heading">
    <h3 id="opening-description-heading">{opening.title}</h3>
    <div id="opening-visual-notes">
      {opening.description.map((paragraph) => <p>{paragraph}</p>)}
    </div>
    <p class="fine-print">{opening.credit}</p>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="deck-images-heading">
    <h3 id="deck-images-heading">Presentation images</h3>
    <p>All homepage images come from the authors’ proposal defense presentation ({deck.source}), slides 15, 17, 18, and 19, converted to WebP without other edits. The car and Waymo photos illustrate human-driven and robot vehicles; the Google Earth and SUMO logos name the tools used to build and simulate the network. Rights in third-party photos and logos remain with their holders.</p>
  </section>
  <p class="fine-print">The video is silent and has a text alternative and a timed description track. It plays automatically when visible unless reduced motion or data saving is enabled; the native controls pause it, and a manual pause is respected when you return.</p>
</section>
